   "html": "<h2><strong>Allison Jamison Woosley Named a 2025 “Best in Finance” Honoree by <em>Louisville Business First</em></strong></h2>\n<p><strong>July 2025, Louisville, KY</strong> – <em>Louisville Business First</em> has officially recognized <strong>Allison Jamison Woosley</strong>, Chief Financial Officer of Vac2Go LLC, as one of the <strong>2025 Best in Finance</strong> honorees, a premier awards program celebrating the top finance professionals in the Louisville metro area.</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2><strong>Why This Honor Matters</strong></h2>\n<p>The <strong>Best in Finance</strong>, presented by Truist, acknowledges outstanding finance professionals who demonstrate excellence in leadership, strategy, and performance in their organizations.</p>\n<h2>&nbsp;</h2>\n<h2><strong>About Allison Jamison Woosley</strong></h2>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Chief Financial Officer</strong> at <strong>Vac2Go LLC</strong>, a Louisville-based industrial vacuum truck rental company.</li>\n<li>Joined Vac2Go in <strong>January 2020</strong>, bringing over two decades of financial leadership experience, including roles in public accounting and as a CFO in national manufacturing.</li>\n<li>Holds a <strong>B.S. in Accounting</strong> from Western Kentucky University and is a <strong>Certified Public Accountant.</strong></li>\n<li>Known within the organization and industry as a strategic leader driving growth, operational efficiency, and fiscal excellence.</li>\n</ul>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>Strategic Leadership &amp; Impact at Vac2Go</strong></h2>\n<p>Under Allison’s financial stewardship, Vac2Go has navigated partnership transitions and growth opportunities. Notably, she played a key role in a major acquisition by Argosy Private Equity in <strong>March 2023. </strong>A strategic move enabling expansion of fleet and geographic reach. Her leadership helped Vac2Go elevate its service excellence and financial performance in a highly technical and customer-driven rental industry.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>Congratulations to Allison!</strong></h2>\n<p>Being named a 2025 Best in Finance honoree is a standout achievement and reflection of Allison Jamison Woosley’s leadership and impact. Her strategic contributions at Vac2Go serve as a model for finance professionals striving to align financial discipline with operational growth and innovation.</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<h2><strong>About Vac2Go</strong></h2>\n<p>Vac2Go is a leading vacuum truck rental company operating a network of ten strategically located rental and service locations throughout the United States. Vac2Go offers customers one of the broadest and most diverse fleets of modern, high-quality vacuum equipment in the industry. In addition, all locations offer repair &amp; maintenance services, used equipment sales, and parts and accessories. Vac2Go currently operates in Alabama, Arizona, Florida, Indiana, Kentucky, New Jersey, Ohio, South Carolina, Tennessee, and Texas.</p>\n<p>For more information about Vac2Go’s services and locations, please visit&nbsp;<a href=\"https://vac2go.com/\">www.vac2go.com</a>.</p>\n<p>Louisville Business First Article: <a href=\"https://www.bizjournals.com/louisville/c/2025-best-in-finance-awards.html\">https://www.bizjournals.com/louisville/c/2025-best-in-finance-awards.html</a></p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>\n<p>&nbsp;</p>",
